⸻
Pumpkin Spice Recipe:
3 Tbsp Ground Cinnamon
2 tsp Ground Ginger
2 tsp Nutmeg
1.5 tsp Ground Allspice
1.5 tsp Ground cloves

Gelato Recipe (cup measurements in video):
2% Milk 521g
33% Cream 100g
Allulose 95g
SMP 31g
Pumpkin Spice 5-10g to suit
Stabilizer 2g
